cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If BugBrain makes your experiment stranger or more reproducible, please cite it."
title: "BugBrain: Connectome-routed review and trained software-agent control"
type: software
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-09-14
authors:
  - name: "Veridical Research"
    email: "contact@veridical.dev"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Veridical-dev/bugbrain"
url: "https://github.com/Veridical-dev/bugbrain"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - code review
  - connectomics
  - Drosophila
  - reservoir computing
  - agentic AI
abstract: >-
  BugBrain routes independent agentic code reviewers using a fixed reservoir
  derived from the FlyWire adult fruit-fly connectome, trains a sparse
  connectome-constrained software-agent controller, and evaluates biological
  topology against matched graph and observation-only controls.
